      "text": "Mau tahu serunya kunjungan ke Jakarta Smart City? 🎉\n\nRekap pekan ini, JSCTroops berkenalan dan berdiskusi bersama perwakilan Pemerintah Kota Palembang dan para pelajar yang antusias untuk mencari tau tentang digitalisasi layanan publik, peran data, serta bagaimana JAKI mendukung kebutuhan warga Jakarta sehari-hari.\n\nGimana kesan mereka selama berkunjung? Cek video berikut ini! 🎥\n\nPenasaran dan ingin berkunjung juga? Ajukan melalui: https://smartcity.jakarta.go.id/id/kunjungan/\n\n_______\nWant to know what happened during this week’s Jakarta Smart City visit? 🎉\n\nThis week’s recap: JSCTroops held discussions with representatives of Palembang City Government, exploring public service digitalization, the role of data, and how JAKI supports the everyday needs of Jakarta’s residents.\nWhat were their impressions during the visit? Check out these videos! 🎥\n\nInterested in visiting too?  Apply through https://smartcity.jakarta.go.id/id/kunjungan/ \n\n#JakartaSmartCity #JAKI #JakartaKini #JakartaKotaGlobal",
      "text_translation": "Want to know the excitement of a visit to Jakarta Smart City? 🎉\n\nRecap of this week, JSCTroops got to know and discuss with representatives of Palembang City Government and students who are enthusiastic to find out about digitalization of public service, the role of data, and how JAKI supports the needs of Jakarta's everyday citizens.\n\nHow did they impress during the visit? Check out the following video! 🎥\n\nCurious and want to visit too? Apply via: https://smartcity.jakarta.go.id/id/kunjungan/\n\n _______ \n Want to know what happened during this week’s Jakarta Smart City visit? 🎉 \n\n This week’s recap: JSCTroops held discussions with representatives of Palembang City Government, exploring public service digitalization, the role of data, and how JAKI supports the everyday needs of Jakarta’s residents. \n What were their impressions during the visit? Check out these videos! 🎥 \n\n Interested in visiting too? Apply through https://smartcity.jakarta.go.id/id/kunjungan/ \n\n #JakartaSmartCity #JAKI #JakartaKini #JakartaKotaGlobal",
